"""The Bazel flags that take no separate value: booleans in both spellings
(`--stamp`, `--nostamp`) and expansion flags (`--remote_download_all`).

GENERATED by tools/gen_bazel_value_flags.sh from `bazel help` - do not edit by
hand. Regenerate after a Bazel release. The union across 6.6.0, 7.7.3, 8.9.0, 9.3.3, 11.0.0-pre.20261114.1.

Consumed by `bazel/flags.axl`, which gives them to the `args.passthrough()`
buckets as `known_flags_from`: flags the bucket forwards that take no value.
A feature's bare `--<name>` flag is left off wherever a bucket forwards that
spelling, so a feature never takes a flag from Bazel.
"""

